  "ruleText": "Cor 101.16 “Patient” means an individual who is committed to the care of the commissioner pursuant to RSA 622:40-48 and housed in the secure psychiatric unit.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Cor 100) #7446, eff 2-6-01; ss by #12500, eff 3-23-18 (formerly Cor 101.16) (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Cor 100)",
